Clinical Course: The anti-nausea medication will allow you to hold down small amounts of fluid tonight, but the hormonal nausea of early pregnancy may require daily medication management by your GP for several weeks.

SAFETY-NETTING ADVICE

Go directly to the nearest Emergency Department if you develop a sudden, sharp pain in your lower stomach or pelvis, if you begin bleeding from the vagina, or if you feel faint and dizzy and cannot stand up.

